                <p>Source: Carter Library, National Security Affairs, Brzezinski Material, Subject File, Box 36, Memcons: President: 4/78. Secret; Sensitive.
                        Carter spoke with Callaghan by phone from the Oval Office. The
                    memorandum is scheduled to be printed in full in <ref target="frus1977-80v27">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations,</hi> 1977–1980, vol. XXVII,
                        Western Europe</ref>.</p>
            </note>
